  "remaining": [
    "Privileged hooks and further delegates must register before forwarding work. Unmediated power paths and other hypervisor protocols need an authority with suitable terminal evidence.",
    "The trusted systemd and QEMU adapters supply the same-ticket terminal premise; kernel flock, persistent storage, entropy and Ed25519 verification are outside the Lean model.",
    "Losing the original terminal evidence leaves the slot occupied. Independent rollback of guest or provider storage and reconciliation after loss of the sole witness need a separate recovery contract."
  ]
